n (in minutes)\n*   Upload Frequency (Videos per week/month)\n*   Current VPH (Views Per Hour) of the 3 most recent videos\n*   Breakout Score (Identify which specific videos are pulling the majority of the current 30-day view volume)\n\n**7. Total Earnings Till Date (Lifetime Financials)**\n*   **Total Earnings Till Date:** Calculate by doing `(Total Lifetime Views / 1000) * Channel Long-Form RPM`. *(Note: For Mixed channels, isolate long-form views only for accurate math).*\n*   **Historical Monthly Average:** Total Earnings Till Date / Channel Age (in months).\n*   **Growth Status:** Compare the \"Historical Monthly Average\" against the \"Current Estimated 30-Day Revenue\". State clearly if the channel is currently GROWING, STAGNATING, or DECLINING.","thinking":"**Reviewing the Inclusion**\n\nOkay, so I've confirmed that \"total earnings till date\" is already present, which answers the user's initial question. I'm moving on to the implications of its positioning; it's already there, so no changes are immediately needed.\n\n\n"}
